# Schema Change Checklist

Use this checklist whenever you add or modify a canonical taxonomy value:

- object type (`type`, `objectType`, collection type)
- skill content type (`contentType`)
- workflow artifact type (`artifactType`)

Do not ship schema or taxonomy changes unless every applicable section below is reviewed.

## 1) Canonical Sources

- `lib/knowledge-types.ts`
  - `VALID_TYPES`
  - type unions
  - `getTypeLabel()`
- `lib/skill-types.ts`
  - `CONTENT_TYPES`
  - `ContentType`
  - `getContentTypeLabel()`
  - `isValidContentType()`
- Workflow artifact taxonomy docs and types (Group Content Workflow)

## 2) Runtime Logic and Prompting

- `lib/context-assembly.ts`
  - `formatContentType()` labels
- `lib/classifier.ts`
  - allowed target types in prompt/validation
- Any type-gated orchestration code (workflow scheduler, validators)

## 3) Internal API Validation

- Knowledge routes:
  - `app/api/knowledge/route.ts`
  - `app/api/knowledge/[id]/route.ts`
- Skills routes:
  - `app/api/skills/route.ts`
  - `app/api/skills/[id]/route.ts`
- Submission/review routes:
  - `app/api/submissions/route.ts`
  - `app/api/submissions/[id]/review/route.ts`
  - `app/api/bulk-upload/approve/route.ts`

## 4) External API Contracts

- `app/api/v1/knowledge/route.ts`
- `app/api/v1/knowledge/types/route.ts`
- `app/api/v1/skills/route.ts`
- `app/api/v1/skills/types/route.ts`
- API docs:
  - `docs/API.md`
  - `docs/EXTERNAL_API.md`
  - `docs/user-guides/external-api.md`

## 5) MCP Contracts

- `mcp-server/src/tools/create-object.ts`
- `mcp-server/src/tools/update-object.ts`
- `mcp-server/src/schema.ts`
- Any MCP formatter/resource that enumerates supported types

## 6) UI Surfaces

- Knowledge UI:
  - `app/knowledge/components/knowledge-list.tsx`
  - `app/knowledge/components/type-badge.tsx`
- Skills UI:
  - `app/skills/components/skill-form.tsx`
  - `app/skills/components/skill-list.tsx`

## 7) Tests

- Add/update unit tests for canonical enum + labels
- Add/update API tests for valid/invalid filters and payload validation
- Add/update MCP tests for schema and validation behavior
- Run targeted suites before merge

## 8) Documentation and Roadmap

- Update taxonomy policy in:
  - `docs/roadmap/group-n.md`
  - `docs/roadmap/group-content-workflow.md` (if workflow-related)
- Update implementation docs:
  - `docs/BUSINESS_LOGIC.md`
  - `docs/KNOWLEDGE_BASE.md`
  - user guides affected by new values

## 9) Release Safety

- Verify backward compatibility for existing stored values
- Confirm deterministic fallback labels for unknown values
- Confirm no hardcoded stale enum copies remain
